    "problems": "The synthetic experiments use three training seeds; Table 2 reports cross-seed variation, which is substantial for some baselines. Frontier-model Figure 1 uses 50 trials per length and condition, but its numerical per-model curve values are not given in the text. The paper does not measure induction-head activity or in-context learning.",
    "rows_left_out": "Figure 1 per-model accuracy curves and Figures 3, 5, and 6 are not transcribed as separate rows: their plotted values are figure-only, and the text provides only qualitative or aggregate summaries for the relevant results. Table 6's per-seed summaries are not listed separately; the corresponding aggregate extrapolation results are recorded in r19–r21.",
