    "verdict_notes": "Olsson et al. is cited once, in the introduction, as the usual copying mechanism. Nothing in the paper analyses attention heads. The reader's T5 is not justified: the paper does not argue that any induction-head version is wrong, only that content matching is insufficient for repeated strings. That is a different construct from V1's claim about how induction heads work on typical text."
